    "notes": {
      "en": "<ul><li>Dataset title: Caucasus Protected Areas (IUCN classification).</li><li>Reference year(s) identified from metadata/name: 2017.</li><li>Spatial coverage is limited to the Caucasus ecoregion / study area extent.</li><li>Attribute definitions follow the source GeoPackage schema.</li><li>Bounding box is an approximate Caucasus extent; use MapX Update values from source for precision.</li><li>Please verify licensing and citation with the original data provider before redistribution.</li></ul>",
